                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7180b8ae-2fd6-4ee2-8b43-16c299779eef",
                                "sense_id": "f1fcd4db-61a4-37e9-9b69-042b99335166",
                                "text": "Und der verriet auch noch gleich, welches Lied er am liebsten selbst grölt: „‚Wir sind Schalker, asoziale Schalker, schlafen unter Brücken oder in der Bahnhofsmission‘ – Das ist mein absolutes Lieblingslied“, so der Franzose.",
                                "translation": "And while he was at it, [Benjamin Stambouli] also revealed which [fan] song he loves to chant along most: “‘We are Schalkers, anti-social Schalkers, we sleep under bridges or at the station mission’ – that’s my absolutely favorite song”, the Frenchman said.",
                                "english": "And while he was at it, [Benjamin Stambouli] also revealed which [fan] song he loves to chant along most: “‘We are Schalkers, anti-social Schalkers, we sleep under bridges or at the station mission’ – that’s my absolutely favorite song”, the Frenchman said."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
